# Certification evidence — M1.17 (RET-1).
# Evidence is repository-retained: records, metrics, reports, screenshots, logs,
# the manifest, index, summary and completion marker are version-controlled so a
# run survives the process that produced it and remains locatable at release
# review. Only bulk runner output stays ignored; the manifest records every
# retained artifact and its digest.
tests/certification/evidence/*/videos/
tests/certification/evidence/*/artifacts/
!tests/certification/evidence/RUN-M0R-001/artifacts/
